# Files Docker should NOT send into the build.
# Unlike .gitignore, a pattern here only matches at the repo root unless it
# starts with **/ - so "node_modules/" alone would still copy frontend/node_modules
# (macOS binaries) over the Linux ones that `npm ci` installed in the image.

# Git and CI
.git
.github
.gitignore

# Secrets: never bake .env files into an image (root or any subfolder)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Python
**/venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/celerybeat-schedule*
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov

# Node / frontend build output
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/npm-debug.log*

# Editors and OS
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.log
